      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63048",
      ":question/problem": "A teacher graded the results of a math test using a $4$-point scale. The distribution of the grades is shown in the following frequency table.\n\n| Grade | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $1$ | $3$ |\n| $2$ | $6$ |\n| $3$ | $8$ |\n| $4$ | $5$ |\n\nHow many students got a grade of $3$ on the test?"
