      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-63131",
      ":question/problem": "Several people were interviewed about the number of portable electronic devices they owned. The following frequency table shows the distribution of the responses obtained.\n\n| Number of E-devices | Frequency |\n| --- | ---: |\n| $0$ | $2$ |\n| $1$ | $10$ |\n| $2$ | $15$ |\n| $3$ | $12$ |\n\nHow many people responded that they have only one electronic device?"
